{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "kinkakuji",
  "chunk_id": "kinkakuji-chunk-1090",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01090",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "我脑海里突然生起的念头，难道就是柏木所说的残暴的念头吗？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Was the thought that had suddenly arisen in my mind the very cruel thought Kashiwagi had spoken of?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01090",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "不管怎么说，这种念头摔然在我内心中产生，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "In any case, this thought suddenly came into being within me,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01090",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "从刚才起就启示了闪耀着的意义，明晃晃地照亮了我的内心。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and from that moment it revealed a shining meaning, brightly illuminating the inside of my heart.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01090",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "我还没顾及深思，这种念头就犹如闪光，在我的心中一闪而过。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Before I had time to think deeply about it, the thought flashed through my heart like a spark of light.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01090",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "仅此而已。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "That was all.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01090",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "但是，这个迄今从未想过的想法产生了，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But this idea, one I had never thought of until now, had arisen,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01090",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "同时立即给我增添了力量，增添了莫大的力量。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and at once it gave me strength, an immense strength.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01090",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "毋宁说我被它包围了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Rather, I should say that I was enveloped by it.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01090",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "这种念头是什么呢？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "What was this thought?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01090",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "就是：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It was this:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
